<map id="auditx_admin_guide">
  <title>AuditX Administrator Guide</title>
  <shortdesc>Complete guide for system administrators responsible for setting up, configuring, and managing AuditX deployments. Includes system initialization, user management, workflow configuration, and reporting.</shortdesc>

